OL,3,APip benefit system 'not fit for
OL,4,Apurpose' and 'dehumanising' assessments
OL,5,Ashould change, review finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour million people claim Pip, a
OL,8,Fregular cash payment towards the extra
OL,9,Fcosts of being disabled. Eligibility
OL,10,Fisn't dependent on income - how much
OL,11,Fmoney do people receive from Pip?
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
