OL,3,AHuntley murderer handed new whole life
OL,4,Ajail term
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triple murderer who beat the
OL,7,Fnotorious child-killer Ian Huntley to
OL,8,Fdeath in prison has been given a second
OL,9,Fwhole life jail term.
OL,11,FAnthony Russell, 44, repeatedly
OL,12,Fbludgeoned Huntley, 52, with a metal
OL,13,Fbar at the high security Frankland
OL,14,FPrison near Durham in February,
OL,15,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FRussell, who was jailed for life with
OL,18,Fno chance of parole in March 2022 for
OL,19,Fraping and murdering a pregnant woman
OL,20,Fand killing a mother and son in the
OL,21,FWest Midlands, admitted Huntley's
OL,22,Fmurder on the second day of his trial.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
