OL,3,AWhat Jensen Huang's return teaches
OL,4,AChina's Xi about Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang's reinstatement as Nvidia
OL,7,FCEO has riveted the world - including
OL,8,FChina, where it has become the top
OL,9,Ftrending post on Weibo, the country's
OL,10,Fbiggest social media platform.
OL,12,FMost users are pleased to see the
OL,13,Freturn of the influential billionaire,
OL,14,Fwho declared that he loved China,
OL,15,Fbefore videos appeared online of him
OL,16,Feating noodles and drinking milk tea
OL,17,Fduring a visit in May. Some wondered
OL,18,Fwhy - in the video of him returning to
OL,19,FNvidia's headquarters - he is not
OL,20,Fwearing one of his leather jackets.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
